# walk: the saved game (level 1), a path through the corridors the autopilot found on the original: steps, turns,
# blocked moves and the wall button (m). What a step and a turn cost.
option save fixtures/EOBDATA.SAV
idle
mark load
key ENTER
idle
shot view
mark step
key UP
mark turn
key HOME
mark step
key UP
mark turn
key HOME
mark step
key UP
mark turn
key PGUP
key PGUP
key PGUP
mark step
key UP
key UP
key UP
key UP
key UP
key UP
mark touch
key m
mark turn
key HOME
mark step
key UP
mark touch
key m
mark turn
key HOME
mark step
key UP
key UP
key UP
key UP
mark turn
key PGUP
mark step
key UP
mark turn
key PGUP
mark step
key UP
key UP
key UP
mark turn
key PGUP
mark step
key UP
key UP
mark touch
key m
mark turn
key PGUP
mark step
key UP
key UP
mark turn
key PGUP
key PGUP
key PGUP
mark step
key UP
idle
shot end
quit
